| Base Table | Dynamic Filters Applied | Rows Read |
|-----------|------------------------|-----------|
| mc (2.6M) | company_id range (from cn build) | 2,609,129 |

Node-based: Final query dynamic filters:

| Base Table | Dynamic Filters Applied | Rows Read | Time |
|-----------|------------------------|-----------|------|
| cast_info (36M) | role_id=4, person_id range + IN BF(person_id) | 1,087,110 | 0.05s |
| title (2.5M) | id range, id IN BF(movie_id) | 233,845 | 0.15s |
| name (4.2M) | id range, id IN BF(person_id) | 43,415 | 0.16s |
| temp1 (1.15M) | movie_id range (only with SQL temp table) | 1,153,795 | 0.00s |
