## Opt-10: Gap 1 Fix -- JFP Support for LogicalColumnDataGet (DONE)

### What

Allow JFP to push dynamic filters TO temp table scans within a single subquery
execution. This automatically enables Bloom filters, IN filters,
SelectivityOptionalFilter, and cast-through pushdown for temp table targets.

### Files changed (DuckDB branch AQP_JIT_152)

