| Sum of negative improvements | -0.056s |

#### Top 10 Regressions (gap vs none-split increased)

| Query | Old gap | New gap | Gap change |
|-------|:-------:|:-------:|:----------:|
| 31a | +0.003s | +0.057s | +0.054s |
| 10c | +0.077s | +0.116s | +0.039s |
| 9a | +0.008s | +0.045s | +0.037s |
| 19d | +0.137s | +0.171s | +0.034s |
