overlap with the middleware's BFs (Opt-11), causing redundant filtering work. The
selectivity check (Opt-14) auto-disables the middleware BFs but the native BFs
also go through SelectivityOptionalFilter sampling, adding overhead.

Alternative: Opt-15 changes join ordering decisions by altering which joins get
`build_side_has_filter=true`, affecting DuckDB's cost model.

